	DCA	ECHOSW			/FORCE ECHO ON
SCRIB1,	TAD	MESSAGE			/GET POINTER TO STRING
	DCA I	SCRIBE/[XSCRIBE]	/MAKE THINGS LOOK LIKE JMS
	JMP I	SCRIB1/[SCRIBE+1]	/AND GO TO WORK

