	DCA	CHAR				/NO, SAVE IT
	TAD	PUTNDX				/GET CURRENT INDEX
	TAD	LINLEN/[INPBUF&177+7600^2]	/SEE IF LINE IS TOO LONG
	SMA CLA					/SKIP IF NOT
