PLEASE,	JMS I	FLIPECHO/[ECHOFLP]	/REVERSE ECHO
	JMS I	SCRIBE/[XSCRIBE]	/NOW MAYBE PRINT
	INPBUF				/THE INPUT BUFFER
	JMS I	FLIPECHO/[ECHOFLP]	/RESTORE ECHO
