	TAD	(JMS	MESSAGE)		/RESET THE
	DCA I	(CTCPZAP)			/<^C> PRINT ROUTINE
	TAD	FCJMPB/(JMP I	PBEGIN/[BEGIN])	/RESET THE
	DCA I	(CTCZAP)			/<^C> HANDLER
	JMP I	WHATMORE/[XWHATMORE]		/BACK TO THE MONITOR
