TMNYZAP,SKP			/**** TOO MANY FILES **** 0000
	JMP I	WHAT/[XWHAT]	/JUMP IF TOO MANY FILES
	TAD	UNIT		/ADD ON UNIT BITS
	DCA I	FILPTR		/STORE A FILE SPECIFICATION
	ISZ	FILPTR		/BUMP TO NEXT FILE
